{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『我……有个喜欢的人』", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2472", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "从樱乃她说完那句话后，已经好几天了。", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "以那件事为分界，樱乃的态度变了。\\n……是不可能的。", "text_idx": 188, "plain": "以那件事为分界，樱乃的态度变了。……是不可能的。", "plain_idx": 189, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那句话是认真的吗，“喜欢的人”的意义与我想的又是否一致，这些我都无从知晓……", "text_idx": 190, "plain": "那句话是认真的吗，“喜欢的人”的意义与我想的又是否一致，这些我都无从知晓……", "plain_idx": 190, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总之那件事之后樱乃没有任何的变化。", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没错，樱乃的态度没有变化。", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "有变化的……是我啊。", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃那个时候的态度与话语，令我一直十分在意。", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她从来没有和我聊过这种话题。", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不知为什么，樱乃她看起来似乎对恋爱话题\\n一直都不怎么感兴趣的样子……", "text_idx": 196, "plain": "不知为什么，樱乃她看起来似乎对恋爱话题一直都不怎么感兴趣的样子……", "plain_idx": 197, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你这表情真有意思」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht1026", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……但看完你笑不出来吧？」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么，你还挺有自知之明啊」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht1027", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，有什么事儿？」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「早就到午休了，\\n　你是完全没有注意到吗？」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": "「早就到午休了，　你是完全没有注意到吗？」", "plain_idx": 205, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht1028", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸……？」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我扭头看了看，教室里已经是一片喧嚣。", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "嗯……？", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天上的是什么课来着？", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么了，一直在发呆。\\n　难不成是感冒了？」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": "「怎么了，一直在发呆。　难不成是感冒了？」", "plain_idx": 213, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5250", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我身体没问题」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就快点出发。\\n　要挤不进食堂了」", "text_idx": 217, "plain": "「那就快点出发。　要挤不进食堂了」", "plain_idx": 218, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn2135", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「樱乃已经先一步过去等我们了」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5251", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……嗯，是啊」", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5252", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「天气变冷了呢」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5253", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理抱住自己，稍稍缩起身子。", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「风也好冷，比起秋天感觉更像是冬天」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2473", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽然我跟冬天无冤无仇，但从今年开始我估计要讨厌它了」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5254", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……因为暖气费？」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2474", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「比想象中还要高啊。\\n　从家里带条毛毯过来会不会好点儿」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": "「比想象中还要高啊。　从家里带条毛毯过来会不会好点儿」", "plain_idx": 235, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5255", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我家里也有，不介意的话要不要用？」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2475", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。要真需要没准儿我会来找你的」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5256", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，什么时候都行」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2476", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「樱乃你看起来一点都不冷啊」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5257", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我还挺喜欢现在这个温度的」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2477", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是吗，稍微有些羡慕啊」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5258", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理你怕冷吗？」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2478", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是很受得了」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5259", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……要不要我抱抱你？」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2479", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那种待遇你还是留着给瓜生吧」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5260", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊呜……」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2480", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……看样子是暖和起来了呢」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5261", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「脸上好烫」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2481", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你要是在瓜生面前露出这副表情，\\n　可是马上就会露馅儿的」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": "「你要是在瓜生面前露出这副表情，　可是马上就会露馅儿的」", "plain_idx": 264, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5262", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在我哥面前我表现得挺正常的」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2482", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……能做到吗？」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5263", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「凭气势和毅力」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2483", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感觉不管哪个你都不沾边儿呀」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5264", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「之前我有试过刻意表现得正常些，但没成功」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2484", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以什么都不考虑才是最好的」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2485", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「顺其自然呢」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5265", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2486", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过看你这样子，进展不太顺利呀」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5266", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2487", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可你是怎么看出来的？\\n　我应该和平时一样吧」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": "「可你是怎么看出来的？　我应该和平时一样吧」", "plain_idx": 287, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2488", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生的态度啊」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5267", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥看起来很奇怪吗？」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2489", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「他又回到了前一段时间的那种状态，\\n　仿佛在烦恼着什么，一直在思考着什么」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": "「他又回到了前一段时间的那种状态，　仿佛在烦恼着什么，一直在思考着什么」", "plain_idx": 294, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5268", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生他啊，对其他的事情都能微笑面对，\\n　唯独牵扯到某个人时，才会烦恼成那样」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": "「瓜生他啊，对其他的事情都能微笑面对，　唯独牵扯到某个人时，才会烦恼成那样」", "plain_idx": 297, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5269", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也就是说，对他而言，那个人就是有那么特别吧……」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5270", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理看着我的脸。", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，樱乃啊，你对瓜生做了些什么，对吧？」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5271", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……我和哥哥说了，我有喜欢的人」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2490", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……这样啊，然后他怎么回答的？」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5272", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是。我和哥哥说的是“我有了喜欢的人”」", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2491", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5273", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理她一副“我服了你了”的表情。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「都说到这个份上了，你还没告诉他呀」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5274", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「果然……还是说不出口」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2492", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那种心情我倒也理解」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5275", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理的苦笑就没停过。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但，看瓜生那个反应，\\n　感觉就算是你现在过去给他说也没问题」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": "「但，看瓜生那个反应，　感觉就算是你现在过去给他说也没问题」", "plain_idx": 320, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5276", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是这样吗？」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2493", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只是在我看来有这种感觉而已」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5277", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……怎么决定还得看我自己？」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2494", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯。不过商量的话随便找我」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5278", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有什么是我能帮你的吗？」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5279", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我也是第一次喜欢一个人，\\n　你能教教我该做些什么才好吗」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": "「……我也是第一次喜欢一个人，　你能教教我该做些什么才好吗」", "plain_idx": 333, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2495", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5280", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你恋爱经验一定很丰富吧」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2496", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没有那回事啦。\\n　那个……我……」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": "「没有那回事啦。　那个……我……」", "plain_idx": 340, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5281", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「难不成爱理也和我一样？」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2497", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……是啊。不，也许我比樱乃还新手」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5282", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喜欢上别人是什么感觉，我也不是很明白」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5283", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我有些吃惊」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2498", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是这种时候应该做些什么呢」", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5284", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「知己知彼，百战百胜」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2499", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽然感觉用在这儿有点不对，但也差不多吧」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5285", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以只要了解哥哥的话，\\n　就一定没问题」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": "「所以只要了解哥哥的话，　就一定没问题」", "plain_idx": 357, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2500", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我觉得应该没有比你还熟悉瓜生的女孩子了」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": "「我觉得应该没有比你还熟悉瓜生的女孩子了」", "plain_idx": 359, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5286", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也不是所有的事情都知道的」", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2501", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以才一直都在注视着瓜生吧」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5287", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我有那么爱盯着哥哥看吗？」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2502", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「自己没感觉吗？」", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5288", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理温柔地笑着。", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「樱乃的视线总是在追寻着瓜生的身影」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5289", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这么说的话，\\n　也许哥哥已经注意到了」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": "「这么说的话，　也许哥哥已经注意到了」", "plain_idx": 373, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2503", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要是从小时候开始就一直都是这样呢？」", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5290", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2504", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「至少我第一次看到樱乃的时候，就是这种感觉」", "text_idx": 379, "plain": "「至少我第一次看到樱乃的时候，就是这种感觉」", "plain_idx": 379, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5291", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我完全没意识到」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2505", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「最开始的时候樱乃的身上也只是给人一种\\n　“超喜欢哥哥的妹妹”的感觉」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": "「最开始的时候樱乃的身上也只是给人一种　“超喜欢哥哥的妹妹”的感觉」", "plain_idx": 384, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5292", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以瓜生才没有注意到吧？」", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5293", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「然而……」", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5294", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「最近的樱乃不管怎么看都是一个陷入爱河的少女」", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5295", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理你在逗我？」", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2506", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没有啦。“知己知彼”首先得是“知己”对吧？」", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5296", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……确实是了解到了自己都不认识的自己」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2507", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以啊，只要再去了解一下敌人\\n　也就是瓜生就好了吧」", "text_idx": 398, "plain": "「所以啊，只要再去了解一下敌人　也就是瓜生就好了吧」", "plain_idx": 399, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5297", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我该怎么做呢？」", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2508", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我想想啊，比如说——」", "text_idx": 403, "plain": "「我想想啊，比如说——」", "plain_idx": 403, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5298", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、嗯。我明白了。再见……」", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "呼……", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「电话？」", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2509", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。濑名同学的电话」", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……是吗」", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2510", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「她被结女的女孩子们问了一大堆问题，\\n　为了给我省事就一次性在电话里全说完了」", "text_idx": 412, "plain": "「她被结女的女孩子们问了一大堆问题，　为了给我省事就一次性在电话里全说完了」", "plain_idx": 413, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「问哥哥的事？」", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2511", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「应该是」", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那作为妹妹我可不能认输，我也想知道各种各样的事情」", "text_idx": 417, "plain": "「那作为妹妹我可不能认输，我也想知道各种各样的事情」", "plain_idx": 417, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2512", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「樱乃你甚至知道我都不知道的我，\\n　所以应该没有什么不知道的吧」", "text_idx": 419, "plain": "「樱乃你甚至知道我都不知道的我，　所以应该没有什么不知道的吧」", "plain_idx": 420, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥你不也知道我不知道的自己，\\n　但是你敢说完全了解我吗？」", "text_idx": 421, "plain": "「哥哥你不也知道我不知道的自己，　但是你敢说完全了解我吗？」", "plain_idx": 422, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2513", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……也是」", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "身为兄妹的同时，毕竟男女有别。", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一定有很多事情是对方不知道的……", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也一定有很多不能让对方知道的事情吧。", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总之这段时间应该会被濑名同学拉着问不少问题吧」", "text_idx": 428, "plain": "「总之这段时间应该会被濑名同学拉着问不少问题吧」", "plain_idx": 428, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我觉得……大家都一样，肯定都想好好了解一下自己喜欢的人」", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2514", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃她现在是在想着她喜欢的那个人吗。", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "身为哥哥，我应该祝福樱乃。", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我应该祝她幸福。", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我一直都明白。\\n她终有一天会迎来那个属于她自己的白马王子。", "text_idx": 434, "plain": "我一直都明白。她终有一天会迎来那个属于她自己的白马王子。", "plain_idx": 435, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没错……我也，能体会那种心情」", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我现在，最想了解的那个人，就是——", "text_idx": 437, "plain": "我现在，最想了解的那个人，就是——", "plain_idx": 437, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
